# Simulate — Windsurf / Cursor Rules

## Project: C# WPF desktop application (Simulate.sln)
## Architecture: MVVM (Model-View-ViewModel)

## Commands
- Build: dotnet build
- Test: dotnet test
- Run: dotnet run --project Simulate

## Conventions
- C# with .NET, XAML for UI
- Conventional commits (feat:, fix:, chore:, refactor:, test:, docs:)
- Named types, explicit access modifiers
- XML doc comments on public API

## Boundaries
- Never commit secrets or credentials
- Never modify files outside the solution without permission
- Ask before adding NuGet dependencies
- Ask before changing project/solution structure
- Always verify build after changes

## Skills
Agent skills are in .agents/skills/. Read .agents/SKILL-CATALOG.md for routing.

